 * PDF stays available as the download. Source of truth for the wording:
 * SocialMedia/kz/lead-magnets/KZ-New-Construction-Prewire-Guide.md (rebuild the PDF from it with
 * build-guide-pdf.py and copy it to public/guides/ when it changes).
 */
