const decisions = [
  { q: 'Where will your equipment live?', a: 'Every system needs a home for the receiver, the network gear, and the cable boxes. Pick that spot early and wire everything back to it.' },
  { q: 'How many TVs, and where?', a: 'Mark every wall that might ever hold a screen. Wire them all.' },
  { q: 'Do you want music in more than one room?', a: 'If yes, whole-home audio has to be wired before drywall. It is very hard to add later.' },
  { q: 'How strong does the Wi-Fi need to be?', a: 'Stone walls, foam insulation, and two stories block signal. Plan wired access point locations now.' },
  { q: 'Cameras and security?', a: 'Wired cameras are more reliable than wireless, and a security system has to be wired at every door and window before insulation. Neither one requires monitoring now, it just has to be in the walls.' },
